          {
           "type": "text",
           "id": "1bd16ec0",
           "html": "KLL provide the whole range of third party assurance services to the railway sector. This includes Notified body (NoBo), Designated Body (DeBo), CSM RAE assessment Body (RAsBo) and independent assessor (ISA)."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
