           "tag": "h3",
           "text": "What we offer"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "column",
         "id": "12695876",
         "size": "50",
         "elements": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "id": "187c35d2",
           "html": "<p>The demand for assurance services are increasing as EU regulations and TSIs becomes mandatory in more and more projects. Our teams are closely monitoring the development of new standards and regulations to make sure our knowledge is at the forefront of industry trends.</p><p>This enables us to deliver certificates, intermediate statements of verifications (ISV), technical files and reports in line with customer needs and the demand of national and international authorities.</p>"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
